# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Session bootstrap for this repository.
#
# Loaded automatically at aider startup via the `load:` key in
# .aider.conf.yml. Keep it short — every line here runs before the interactive
# prompt appears.
#
# Lines starting with `#` are ignored. Lines starting with `!` run as shell
# commands. Lines starting with `/` run as aider slash-commands.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------


# Open the calculator. Replace with any tool you want at session start.
!open -a Calculator >/dev/null 2>&1